Week 4 Capstone Project
Production-Grade AI Voice Agent for Real Estate Conversational AI • Voice • RAG • Workflows • Scheduling • Human-like UrduLish
📌 Scenario
Your client is a real estate company that receives dozens of calls every day from potential buyers, renters, and investors. Hiring agents to answer every inquiry is expensive and inconsistent.
Your task is to build a production-ready AI Voice Agent that answers incoming calls, speaks naturally in fluent UrduLish (Urdu + English mixed conversational style), understands customer intent, answers property-related questions using company knowledge, recommends suitable properties, handles objections, schedules property visits, and integrates with business workflows.
The system should behave like a professional human real estate sales representative, not a chatbot.
The final product should be deployable for an actual client.
Technologies Expected
The project should expose students to a complete modern AI stack.
LLM: OpenAI GPT, Claude, Gemini
Voice: Fish Audio (Recommended), ElevenLabs (Optional comparison), OpenAI Realtime (optional)
Speech Recognition: Deepgram, Whisper, AssemblyAI
Agent Framework: LangGraph, LangChain
Vector Database: ChromaDB, Pinecone, Weaviate, FAISS
Workflow Automation: n8n, LangGraph workflows
Backend: FastAPI
Database: PostgreSQL, MongoDB
Scheduling: Google Calendar API
Email: Gmail API, Microsoft Outlook API, Resend API
Deployment: Docker, Railway, Render, AWS, Azure
Project Objectives
Build a production-ready AI voice agent capable of:
✅ Answering phone calls
✅ Speaking naturally
✅ Fluent UrduLish
✅ Human-like conversation
✅ Remembering context
✅ Understanding customer intent
✅ Property recommendation
✅ Handling objections
✅ RAG-based factual answers
✅ Booking appointments
✅ Sending emails
✅ Google Calendar integration
✅ Rescheduling appointments
✅ Canceling appointments
✅ Logging conversations
✅ CRM-ready architecture

