Fish Audio Recommendation
For this project, Fish Audio is an excellent alternative to ElevenLabs, particularly if your primary goal is natural UrduLish conversations.
Advantages of Fish Audio:
More expressive and emotionally natural speech
Strong multilingual capabilities, including smoother code-switching between Urdu and English
Better streaming support for low-latency voice agents
High-quality voice cloning
Competitive pricing for production workloads
Suitable for conversational agents that need human-like pauses and intonation
Suggested Voice Stack:
Speech-to-Text: Deepgram Nova-3 (or Whisper Large V3 if offline support is required)
LLM: GPT-5.5, Claude, or Gemini
Agent Framework: LangGraph
Knowledge Layer: ChromaDB or Pinecone with RAG
Text-to-Speech: Fish Audio
Workflow Automation: n8n
Calendar: Google Calendar API
Email: Gmail API or Microsoft Graph API
Backend: FastAPI
Deployment: Docker + Railway/Render/AWS
This combination offers a strong balance of conversational quality, low latency, scalability, and maintainability for a production-ready real estate voice agent.

